  "proof_lemmas": [
    "Every special-vertex link is a two-graph delta(X); its 0/2 ridge rule is equivalent to X being triangle-free and induced-2K2-free. The exact census leaves 42 fixed-base types.",
    "For link signature (y,q,r), Dehn--Sommerville forces z = 150-2*(sum(q)+a0)-sum(y). Exhausting all admissible signatures derives exactly ten branches.",
    "After one common isolate relabelling fixes an E or H link, all 5,775 or 4,620 labelled copies of the second link and every labelled Z support are enumerated. No branch satisfies both the no-missing-triples theorem and its forced a0 value."
  ],
